# The Unknown World's dark way (K1), from the temple's summit: Bastila,
# Malak's now, joined; the Jedi with the party fight; the field down; on
# the beach Carth flees and Mission and Zaalbar, turned on, are fought;
# the Ebon Hawk mended and away to the Star Forge. Branches off the light
# route's checkpoint at the summit:
#   kjk playthrough k1 @uw_summit data/routes/k1/unknown_world_dark.route --god
say =yes! together we can rule the galaxy!
say i like this side of you
say i am the lord of the sith
say death to the jedi
to unk44_bastcs
talk
fight 30                 # the Jedi with the party turn on you
talk
save dk_bastila_joined
use RakatCom             # the disruptor field and the temple's shield down
talk
if UNK_SHIELD_OFF=0       # the exit trigger's line took the computer's turn (a
use RakatCom             # party member walked into it first): used again
talk
end
exit unk44_tpllckdoor
exit unk44_exitdoor
exit unk41_goto41aad
save dk_beach
to unk41_goebon          # Carth runs; Mission won't swear, Zaalbar won't
fight 30                 # turn on her: both fought
if in unk_m41aa          # still ashore (the fight kept the party off):
to newfight              # out of the way aboard and in again, its script
to unk41_goebon          # running as one enters
end
module ebo_m41aa
use Hyperdrive
use ebo41_galaxymap
travel 10
module ebo_m12aa
save dk_star_forge
